   258	    Key insight:
   259	    - Internal body strips are intentionally repetitive, so geometry alone cannot order them; but color matching alone is also ambiguous because rotating a strip can swap its incoming and outgoing colors. The correct assembly appears only when rotation recovery and color-chain matching are solved together.
   260	    """

